<Layout title="Money Mindsets | RIPL Wealth" description="Discover the Builder, Accumulator, Navigator and Steward money mindsets, and your tendency toward safety or opportunity.">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">MONEY MINDSETS</div><h1>The way you think about money right now<br><span class="ripl-gold">is quietly shaping your future.</span></h1><p class="lead">We’ve seen four money mindsets in the people we work with, and two tendencies that guide the way money flows through their lives.</p><div class="page-actions"><a class="btn" href="/assessment/">Discover My Wealth Persona →</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Talk to the Team</a></div></div></section>

<section class="section questions"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE BASIC BUILDING BLOCKS</div><h2>The four money mindsets.</h2>
  <div class="mind-grid">
    <article class="card"><span class="num">01</span><h3>The Builder</h3><p>Everything you make goes back into what you’re creating.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="num">02</span><h3>The Accumulator</h3><p>Income is arriving faster than the structure around it.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="num">03</span><h3>The Navigator</h3><p>A sale, a contract, retirement, or a life change has raised new questions.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="num">04</span><h3>The Steward</h3><p>You’re thinking beyond yourself: family, community, and the causes you care about.</p></article>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR MONEY TENDENCY</div><div class="questions-head"><h2>Do you tend toward safety,<br>or do you look for opportunity?</h2><p>Your mindset is how you think about money. Your tendency is how you act when you have it. You may recognize more than one mindset, and your priorities can change as life changes.</p></div>
  <div class="pillar-grid">
    <div class="pillar"><span class="num">SAFETY</span><h3>You like knowing exactly where your money is.</h3><p>You like having cash available. You want what you’ve built to feel protected, steady, and dependable.</p></div>
    <div class="pillar"><span class="num">OPPORTUNITY</span><h3>You like seeing your money grow.</h3><p>You are always looking for the next place for it to go, and you love finding and backing new opportunities.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>


<section class="assessment-band ripl-ripple" data-motion=""><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">A THREE-MINUTE START</div><h2>Discover your<br><span class="assessment-highlight">wealth persona.</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">Your mindset and your tendency make your wealth persona.</p><p>See your strengths, the patterns worth questioning, and a few ideas for your next stage.</p><a class="btn" href="/assessment/">Take the Quiz</a></div></div></section>


</Layout>
